# 💬 OPIc Expression - Day20

## Today's Expression

### As a result,...

Meaning:

그 결과 ~했다.

---

## When to Use

어떤 행동이나 사건의 결과를 설명할 때 사용한다.

OPIc에서 이야기를 자연스럽게 연결해 주는 표현이다.

---

## Examples

I studied every day. As a result, my English improved.

I missed the bus. As a result, I arrived late.

I practiced the presentation several times. As a result, I felt more confident.

---

## Useful Patterns

### Because A, B. As a result, C.

I didn't sleep well because I studied late.

As a result, I was tired the next morning.

---

### A happened. As a result, B happened.

The weather suddenly became bad.

As a result, we had to cancel our plans.

---

## Pro Tip

오늘부터 OPIc 답변을

Problem
↓
Action
↓
Result

형태로 연결하는 연습을 한다.

특히 결과를 말할 때

> As a result,...

를 사용하면 답변의 논리적 흐름이 좋아진다.

